    {
      "id": "claim_d7e34013497540589025553097216eff",
      "statement": "API keys are created/relisted/revoked through session APIs under app/api/app/headless-access/**; any current Strap member can create a key with a name, explicit mode, and optional expiry no more than 366 days away. lib/headless-access-shared.ts generates strap_key_ values from random material, persists only SHA-256 digest and short prefix, returns plaintext once, and recognizes creed_key_ solely as compatibility keys; resolution checks revocation, expiry, creator membership, and records last_used_at best-effort.",
