    {
      "id": "claim_f104fcbac43a4d4b95d7ba9091b48f3d",
      "statement": "Four skill tools are the canonical Strap-first skill surface: strap_list_skills (metadata only, includeArchived default false), strap_get_skill (SKILL.md instructions plus bounded manifest or one selected file; archived returns 410), strap_export_skill (full versioned bundle with base64 assets), and strap_publish_skill (publishes a bundle, gated to direct mode + owner/admin). They are appended to tools/list via skillToolsFor(strapId, mode, role); with no connected profile no skill tools are offered, and strap_publish_skill is included only when canPublishSkills(mode, role) is true.",
