      "id": "claim_1f1de34b648c40d88a4f46edce5fc2ff",
      "statement": "@bvdm/strap publishes the strap executable for Node 20+, defaults to https://strap.bvdm.ai/mcp, uses dynamic registration plus browser authorization-code PKCE, discovers tools/resources/prompts live, supports exact-name calls and JSON mode, stores credentials per server, and attempts RFC 7009 revocation on logout. Server precedence is --server, STRAP_MCP_URL, saved config, then the default; STRAP_CONFIG_DIR overrides storage; HTTPS is required except explicit localhost loopback URLs.",
